<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Final Clue</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles.css" />
    <style>
      .clue-container {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
        border-radius: 15px;
        padding: 30px;
        margin: 20px auto;
        max-width: 600px;
        color: white;
        box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
      }
      .clue-text {
        font-size: 1.2em;
        line-height: 1.8;
        font-style: italic;
        margin-bottom: 30px;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .round-info {
        text-align: center;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
        font-size: 1.5em;
        font-weight: bold;
      }
      .final-message {
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
        padding: 20px;
        border-radius: 10px;
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 1.1em;
        margin-top: 20px;
      }
      .logout-btn {
        width: 100%;
        padding: 12px;
        background: #4caf50;
        color: white;
        border: none;
        border-radius: 5px;
        font-size: 1.1em;
        cursor: pointer;
        transition: all 0.3s;
        text-decoration: none;
        display: block;
        margin-top: 20px;
      }
      .logout-btn:hover {
        background: #45a049;
        transform: translateY(-2px);
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="grid-bg"></div>

    <div class="container">
      <div class="header">
        <h1>Treasure Hunt Complete</h1>
      </div>

      <div class="clue-container">
        <div class="round-info">Final Clue</div>

        <div class="clue-text">
          End is the new beginning…the end is calling ✨
        </div>

        <div class="final-message">
          <p>You have completed all 3 rounds.</p>
          <p style="margin-top: 15px">
            Our team will contact you shortly for the results.
          </p>
          <a href="/logout" class="logout-btn">LOGOUT</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
